### Health (NestJS gateway)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Chat with optional API key (set API_KEY in .env first)
# @apiKey = your-api-key-here
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "query": "X-402 payment service staging deploy failure"
}

### Chat via backend → RAG engine (run scripts/seed.ps1 first)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "X-402 payment service staging deploy failure"
}

### Streaming chat (SSE) via backend → RAG engine
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "query": "What configuration change caused the payment gateway timeout on staging?",
  "environment": "staging",
  "source_types": ["ansible", "k8s", "log"]
}

### Filtered demo query (seeded staging payment-service incident)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What configuration change caused the payment gateway timeout on staging?",
  "environment": "staging",
  "source_types": ["ansible", "k8s", "gitlab_ci", "log"]
}

### RAG engine direct
GET http://localhost:8000/health

POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "error 192.168.1.50 connection refused"
}

### Query with metadata filters (environment + source_types)
POST http://localhost:8000/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "X-402 payment gateway timeout",
  "environment": "staging",
  "source_types": ["ansible", "gitlab_ci"]
}

### Scrape K8s manifests from configured path (filesystem mode)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ingest/scrape/k8s
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "environment": "staging"
}

### Scrape Ansible playbooks from configured path
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ingest/scrape/ansible
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "environment": "staging"
}

### Forward runtime logs to ingest queue
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ingest/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "2026-06-06T10:15:00Z ERROR payment-service X-402 gateway timeout connecting to 192.168.1.50:8443",
  "service_name": "payment-service",
  "environment": "staging",
  "hostname": "pay-stg-01",
  "log_level": "ERROR"
}

### List ingestion jobs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ingest/jobs?limit=20

### Get ingestion job by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ingest/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Sample ingest (requires Postgres running)
POST http://localhost:8000/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "content": "TASK [deploy] Error X-402: payment gateway timeout on 192.168.1.50",
      "source_type": "ansible",
      "metadata": { "playbook": "deploy-payment.yml", "line": 42 },
      "environment": "staging",
      "service_name": "payment-service"
    }
  ]
}
